  "notes": "DRAFT by Claude (s346) for Ben to move in the Map Workshop. NEBO = a round GLADE TOWN in a deep green forest of small hills. The Town Square sits in an octagon Glade Walk; the brief's two avenues (ELDER WAY north-south, WILDWOOD WAY east-west) run out through the LANTERN RING, an octagon lantern road that circles the town. Groves of trees fill the four corners inside the ring. Out in the woods: CASTLE PATH north over the NEBO BROOK (bridge) to Elder Nova's castle + the Lodge; COMMUNITY GARDEN south; FOREST PATH east to the Ranger's Cabin, the Bike Park, the FOREST MEADOW pond and up the DEEP WOODS trail; GIANT TREE PATH west to the giant tree (The Climb inside, Tree Top on the crown). One TIMBER ROAD (vehicles) from the Canopy Dock in the south-west to Cedar's Lumber Mill. Trees are scattered by terrain.forests (new in s346: no tree ever lands on a path, door or building). NPC keys are draft until the 2D file comes in.",
